  m_Text: 'The commotion from your household is nothing new. Arguments have become
    almost routine, and last night there was even a loud crash that startled everyone
    nearby.

    Such incidents have long been the subject of whispers. Your conduct
    is both troubling and unsettling.

    Show some restraint, and stop letting
    the whole village suffer for it.'
